**subject to**

$$
x_A + x_B + x_C + x_D = 2000
$$

$$
x_A \leq 900\, y_A
$$

$$
x_B \leq 1000\, y_B
$$

$$
x_C \leq 1200\, y_C
$$

$$
x_D \leq 1600\, y_D
$$

**where**

$$
x_A, x_B, x_C, x_D \geq 0 \quad (\text{continuous})
$$

$$
y_A, y_B, y_C, y_D \in \{0,1\} \quad (\text{binary})
$$
